The server error: noEmit: true

Cannot find module '...\dist\server.js' means the dist folder doesn’t exist. Your tsconfig.json has this line:

json
"noEmit": true

noEmit tells tsc to check your code for errors but write no files. So npm run build passes, produces no dist, and npm start has nothing to run. Remove that line:

